                <invention-title lang="de">RÜCKENLEHNENVERRIEGELUNGSMECHANISMUS UND KINDERSICHERHEITSSITZ DAMIT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">MÉCANISME DE VERROUILLAGE DE DOSSIER ET SIÈGE DE SÉCURITÉ POUR ENFANT ASSOCIÉ</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">BACKREST LOCKING MECHANISM AND CHILD SAFETY SEAT THEREWITH</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A backrest locking mechanism is adapted for a backrest and a base of a child safety seat. The backrest is detachably connected to the base. The backrest locking mechanism comprises a locking pin, a locking component, and an operating component. The locking pin is disposed on the backrest. The locking component is disposed on the base. A locking hole structure is formed on the locking component. The locking pin is configured to detachably engage with the locking hole structure. The operating component is movably disposed on the backrest or the base. The operating component drives the locking pin and the locking hole structure to engage with or disengage from each other when the operating component is operated.</p>
            </abstract>
